        "Description": "The Microslop annual holiday festival has begun. Taking place over the weekend, there are three targets for you to elimintate Agent. A senior executive Lana Caprice, a key investor Shiekh Al-Gazali, and head of a private surveilance corporation,  Kristopher Kringle. Our client wishes for these individuals to pay for their efforts to downsize and ruin the true meaning of the season. Avenge those who have lost their jobs.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\r\rGood luck, Agent.",
